          "text": "Atabadwa Metusela, Enoki anayenda ndi Mulungu zaka 300 ndipo anabereka ana ena aamuna ndi aakazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
